<header>
<h1>Cafe Shibah</h1>
<p>Delicious Meals • Fresh Coffee • Warm Hospitality</p>
<a class="button" href="#menu">View Menu</a>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#menu">Menu</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="about">
<h2>About Us</h2>
<p>
Welcome to Cafe Shibah, located in Maua Town, Meru County.
We serve freshly prepared meals, snacks, coffee and refreshing drinks
in a clean and welcoming environment.
</p>
</section>

<section id="menu">
<h2>Our Menu</h2>

<div class="menu">

<div class="card">
<h3>Breakfast</h3>
<p>Tea, Coffee, Eggs & Chapati</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Lunch</h3>
<p>Pilau, Beef Stew, Chicken & Rice</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Fast Food</h3>
<p>Chips, Burgers & Sausages</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Drinks</h3>
<p>Coffee, Tea, Juice & Soda</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact</h2>

<p><strong>Location:</strong> Maua Town, Meru County</p>

<p><strong>Phone:</strong> 0725 961 278</p>

<p><strong>Opening Hours:</strong> Daily 6:00 AM – 8:00 PM</p>

</section>

<footer>

<h3>Cafe Shibah</h3>

<p>Serving Great Food Every Day.</p>

</footer>

